#: ../../source/mp/l2_storage/bigtable.rst:2
msgid "Bigtable"
msgstr "Bigtable"

#: ../../source/mp/l2_storage/bigtable.rst:4
msgid ""
"An L2 adapter backed by Google Cloud Bigtable, enabling out-of-process "
"remote KV caching. It supports Layer-Group Sharding to partition large "
"tensor payloads across multiple column qualifiers to stay safely under "
"Bigtable cell size limits."
msgstr "一个由 Google Cloud Bigtable 支持的 L2 适配器，能够实现进程外的远程 KV 缓存。它支持层组分片，将大型张量负载划分到多个列限定符中，以确保安全地低于 Bigtable 单元格大小限制。"

#: ../../source/mp/l2_storage/bigtable.rst:7
msgid "Why Choose Bigtable?"
msgstr "为什么选择 Bigtable？"

#: ../../source/mp/l2_storage/bigtable.rst:9
msgid ""
"Cloud Bigtable is an excellent choice as an L2 storage backend for "
"enterprise-scale LLM serving workloads:"
msgstr "Cloud Bigtable 是企业级 LLM 服务工作负载的 L2 存储后端的优秀选择："

#: ../../source/mp/l2_storage/bigtable.rst:11
msgid ""
"**Sub-millisecond/Single-digit Latency**: SSD-backed Bigtable clusters "
"deliver the low latency required for real-time prompt caching, preventing"
" remote cache retrieval from bottlenecking LLM generation."
msgstr "**亚毫秒/单数延迟**：基于 SSD 的 Bigtable 集群提供实时提示缓存所需的低延迟，防止远程缓存检索成为 LLM 生成的瓶颈。"

#: ../../source/mp/l2_storage/bigtable.rst:12
msgid ""
"**High Concurrency and Throughput**: Scales horizontally to handle "
"thousands of concurrent queries from multiple vLLM instances, shielding "
"the L1 memory from cache misses."
msgstr "**高并发和吞吐量**：水平扩展以处理来自多个 vLLM 实例的数千个并发查询，保护 L1 内存免受缓存未命中的影响。"

#: ../../source/mp/l2_storage/bigtable.rst:13
msgid ""
"**Enterprise-Grade Managed Service**: Fully managed by Google Cloud, "
"providing built-in multi-region replication, IAM access controls, and "
"zero-downtime scaling."
msgstr "**企业级托管服务**：由 Google Cloud 完全管理，提供内置的多区域复制、IAM 访问控制和零停机时间的扩展。"

#: ../../source/mp/l2_storage/bigtable.rst:14
msgid ""
"**Tier-Agnostic Storage Flexibility**: Decouples LMCache config from "
"database deployments. Choose the **SSD Tier** for primary low-latency "
"caching, or the **HDD Tier** for cost-effective, large-scale archival "
"storage."
msgstr "**与层级无关的存储灵活性**：将 LMCache 配置与数据库部署解耦。选择 **SSD 层** 作为主要低延迟缓存，或选择 **HDD 层** 作为经济高效的大规模归档存储。"

#: ../../source/mp/l2_storage/bigtable.rst:16
msgid "**Required fields:**"
msgstr "**必填字段：**"

#: ../../source/mp/l2_storage/bigtable.rst:18
msgid "``bigtable_project_id`` (str): Your Google Cloud Project ID."
msgstr "``bigtable_project_id`` (str): 您的 Google Cloud 项目 ID。"

#: ../../source/mp/l2_storage/bigtable.rst:19
msgid "``bigtable_instance_id`` (str): Your Cloud Bigtable Instance ID."
msgstr "``bigtable_instance_id`` (str): 您的 Cloud Bigtable 实例 ID。"

#: ../../source/mp/l2_storage/bigtable.rst:20
msgid "``bigtable_table_name`` (str): Bigtable table name."
msgstr "``bigtable_table_name`` (str): Bigtable 表名。"

#: ../../source/mp/l2_storage/bigtable.rst:22
msgid "**Optional fields:**"
msgstr "**可选字段：**"

#: ../../source/mp/l2_storage/bigtable.rst:24
msgid ""
"``bigtable_family_name`` (str, default ``\"cf\"``): Column family name. "
"Must be pre-created in the Bigtable table."
msgstr "``bigtable_family_name`` (str, default ``\"cf\"``): 列族名称。必须在 Bigtable 表中预先创建。"

#: ../../source/mp/l2_storage/bigtable.rst:25
msgid ""
"``bigtable_column_name`` (str, default ``\"data\"``): Column qualifier "
"name to use when sharding is disabled."
msgstr "``bigtable_column_name`` (str, default ``\\\"data\\\"``): 当禁用分片时使用的列限定符名称。"

#: ../../source/mp/l2_storage/bigtable.rst:26
msgid ""
"``layer_group_size`` (int, default ``10``): Number of layers per column "
"group. Set to ``0`` to disable Layer-Group Sharding."
msgstr "``layer_group_size`` (int, default ``10``): 每个列组的层数。设置为 ``0`` 以禁用层组分片。"

#: ../../source/mp/l2_storage/bigtable.rst:27
msgid ""
"``bigtable_max_chunk_size_mb`` (float, default ``90.0``): The maximum "
"allowed write limit when sharding is disabled (or when using CacheGen). "
"Writes exceeding this are safely skipped to avoid database exceptions."
msgstr "``bigtable_max_chunk_size_mb`` (float, default ``90.0``): 禁用分片时（或使用 CacheGen 时）允许的最大写入限制。超过此限制的写入将被安全跳过，以避免数据库异常。"

#: ../../source/mp/l2_storage/bigtable.rst:28
msgid ""
"``credentials_path`` (str, default ``None``): Absolute path to a GCP "
"Service Account JSON key file. If omitted, it defaults to Application "
"Default Credentials (ADC)."
msgstr "``credentials_path`` (str, default ``None``): GCP 服务账户 JSON 密钥文件的绝对路径。如果省略，则默认为应用程序默认凭据 (ADC)。"

#: ../../source/mp/l2_storage/bigtable.rst:29
msgid ""
"``exists_cache_ttl_seconds`` (float, default ``10.0``): TTL in seconds "
"for the internal cache that shields Bigtable from redundant lookup "
"requests."
msgstr "``exists_cache_ttl_seconds`` (float, default ``10.0``): 用于内部缓存的 TTL（生存时间），单位为秒，该缓存可以保护 Bigtable 免受冗余查找请求。"

#: ../../source/mp/l2_storage/bigtable.rst:30
msgid ""
"``bigtable_write_timeout_ms`` (float, default ``10000.0``): Maximum "
"timeout for database writes."
msgstr "``bigtable_write_timeout_ms`` (float, default ``10000.0``): 数据库写入的最大超时时间。"

#: ../../source/mp/l2_storage/bigtable.rst:31
msgid ""
"``bigtable_read_timeout_ms`` (float, default ``5000.0``): Maximum timeout"
" for database reads."
msgstr "``bigtable_read_timeout_ms`` (float, default ``5000.0``): 数据库读取的最大超时。"

#: ../../source/mp/l2_storage/bigtable.rst:33
msgid ""
"**Environment variable fallbacks.** When the corresponding config value "
"is empty, these environment variables are used: ``BT_PROJECT_ID``, "
"``BT_INSTANCE_ID``, ``BT_TABLE_NAME``."
msgstr "**环境变量回退。** 当相应的配置值为空时，将使用这些环境变量：``BT_PROJECT_ID``、``BT_INSTANCE_ID``、``BT_TABLE_NAME``。"

#: ../../source/mp/l2_storage/bigtable.rst:36
msgid "Tutorials & Configuration Examples"
msgstr "教程与配置示例"

#: ../../source/mp/l2_storage/bigtable.rst:39
msgid "Tutorial 1: Serving Massive Models (FP8 Compression)"
msgstr "教程 1：服务大规模模型（FP8 压缩）"

#: ../../source/mp/l2_storage/bigtable.rst:41
msgid ""
"If you are serving extremely large models where individual KV cache "
"chunks are massive, you can enable FP8 quantization compression. This "
"compresses the KV cache footprint by **2x** and reduces network transfer "
"overhead to Bigtable."
msgstr "如果您正在服务极大的模型，其中单个 KV Cache 块非常庞大，您可以启用 FP8 量化压缩。这将 KV Cache 的占用空间压缩 **2x** 并减少传输到 Bigtable 的网络开销。"

#: ../../source/mp/l2_storage/bigtable.rst:43
msgid ""
"Add the ``\"serde\"`` sub-dictionary inside the Bigtable L2 adapter JSON "
"spec:"
msgstr "在 Bigtable L2 适配器 JSON 规范中添加 ``\"serde\"`` 子字典："

#: ../../source/mp/l2_storage/bigtable.rst:65
msgid ""
"Tutorial 2: 3-Tier Hybrid Storage (Local CPU -> Redis L2 -> Bigtable SSD "
"L3)"
msgstr "教程 2：三层混合存储（本地 CPU -> Redis L2 -> Bigtable SSD L3）"

#: ../../source/mp/l2_storage/bigtable.rst:67
msgid ""
"You can place a Redis/Valkey instance in front of Bigtable to serve as a "
"fast hot cache, cascading requests down to Bigtable on misses."
msgstr "您可以在 Bigtable 前面放置一个 Redis/Valkey 实例，作为快速热缓存，在未命中时将请求级联到 Bigtable。"

#: ../../source/mp/l2_storage/bigtable.rst:69
msgid ""
"Configure multiple L2 adapters sequentially using multiple "
"``--l2-adapter`` arguments:"
msgstr "使用多个 ``--l2-adapter`` 参数按顺序配置多个 L2 适配器："

#: ../../source/mp/l2_storage/bigtable.rst:88
msgid "Tutorial 3: Multi-Tier Storage Cascading (SSD Hot Tier -> HDD Archive)"
msgstr "教程 3：多层存储级联（SSD 热层 -> HDD 存档）"

#: ../../source/mp/l2_storage/bigtable.rst:90
msgid ""
"To balance low-latency performance for hot cache hits and cost-"
"effectiveness for long-term archival storage, you can configure tiered "
"storage (SSD to HDD) in two ways:"
msgstr "为了平衡热缓存命中的低延迟性能和长期归档存储的成本效益，您可以通过两种方式配置分层存储（从 SSD 到 HDD）："

#: ../../source/mp/l2_storage/bigtable.rst:93
msgid ""
"Method A: Native Bigtable Tiered Storage (Recommended - Zero "
"Configuration)"
msgstr "方法 A：原生 Bigtable 分层存储（推荐 - 零配置）"

#: ../../source/mp/l2_storage/bigtable.rst:95
msgid ""
"Google Cloud Bigtable supports native **Tiered Storage**. By enabling an "
"age-based tiering policy on your table via the Google Cloud Console, "
"gcloud CLI, or Terraform, Bigtable automatically moves older/colder cells"
" to a cost-effective infrequent-access storage tier in the background."
msgstr "Google Cloud Bigtable 支持原生 **分层存储**。通过 Google Cloud 控制台、gcloud CLI 或 Terraform 在您的表上启用基于年龄的分层策略，Bigtable 会在后台自动将较旧/较冷的单元格移动到成本效益高的不频繁访问存储层。"

#: ../../source/mp/l2_storage/bigtable.rst:97
msgid ""
"**No LMCache configuration changes**: You only need to configure a single"
" Bigtable L2 adapter in LMCache."
msgstr "**无需更改 LMCache 配置**：您只需在 LMCache 中配置一个 Bigtable L2 适配器。"

#: ../../source/mp/l2_storage/bigtable.rst:98
msgid ""
"**No code changes**: Bigtable handles routing reads and writes to the "
"correct tier transparently."
msgstr "**无需代码更改**：Bigtable 透明地处理将读取和写入路由到正确层级。"

#: ../../source/mp/l2_storage/bigtable.rst:99
msgid ""
"**Natural aging**: Since cells are written with the default server "
"timestamp, they will naturally age out based on the configured policy "
"window."
msgstr "**自然老化**：由于单元格是使用默认的服务器时间戳写入的，因此它们将根据配置的策略窗口自然老化。"

#: ../../source/mp/l2_storage/bigtable.rst:101
msgid ""
"For more information, see the official `Bigtable Tiered Storage Overview "
"<https://cloud.google.com/bigtable/docs/tiered-storage>`_."
msgstr "有关更多信息，请参阅官方的 `Bigtable 分层存储概述 <https://cloud.google.com/bigtable/docs/tiered-storage>`_。"

#: ../../source/mp/l2_storage/bigtable.rst:104
msgid "Method B: Manual LMCache Storage Cascade (Alternative)"
msgstr "方法 B：手动 LMCache 存储级联（替代方案）"

